## @file
#  DebugLib on the serial port that also keeps every message in the memory
#  debug log (OvmfPkg MemDebugLogLib), for DebugReportDxe to save.
#
#  A copy of MdePkg/Library/BaseDebugLibSerialPort with one call added.
